cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and this archive."
title: "Foundation-model embeddings in a differentiable hydrologic model"
abstract: >-
  A modified copy of the dMG differentiable modeling framework, adapted so that
  a differentiable rainfall-runoff model can take pretrained foundation-model
  embeddings as input. Includes the offline embedding pipeline, the CAMELS-531
  and Caravan-3026 experiment configurations, and the analysis scripts.
